        "185",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a208cbd78a7e9cba72a52cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了！什么时候出战？\\n我会把热身的时间也预留出来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43e9e5ce82f80adb31e05646856c9ae20fc74b8a6fa7e2afd2d7c1dabe48dc0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efeaa73d6546fd787a2def4c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP吃得肚子鼓鼓的了呢～。\\n大家一起跑一跑，消化一下吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a3397a87b7e302fdb180677fe09a80ab765eefc2893947482bf64a79a33ace8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b08b788a1b3daf7376933cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呜哇哇，RP恢复了！\\n赛事前不要紧张啊～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69db247245310c8bfb03bc329937eb1023808422044d499ab06171973dca1dd4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:181db4dfa566f7f6698ee483",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经全攒满了……！\\n米浴也会在赛事里努力的……啊，呜呜～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32617a4606a895b67b58549a6df61205cfebffd561b4d9f50b26df214dfeb8ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:656b510b39e6ad55cb1b0928",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇ー伊，RP满了ー！\\n这样就能跑很多次了呢！超级期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ddd8f8d3d77364bed04176f441a8da7c9f44347f541e9ba43814319893ec8bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70d8039968eb21248b125cb4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP完全恢复……听说可以出战赛事了。\\n……那么，该采集哪个样本呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9caf8256eff09208fe05b08ed8bfd92a9622cb1861214ff83e658145173da7c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b12742d0c2ce4f058ffc5707",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "标题：RP已全部恢复\\n我会继续推进赛事的准备工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eab69f0133e533e0982f0729c060b02211e71538f6abbd44e7af8b0dd824add7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:993b44fece744b6dbf1f0dc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔喔，RP满了！\\n稻荷大人的精彩表现，又得让你见识见识了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a90b6dc064be446436e0a61bd5e414c4c5ef5d64e18003743fe6dc5b2f88832d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7212e330cac4a9e238ab0011",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP完全恢复了！！\\n呜喔喔喔ーー！跑起来啦喔喔喔喔ーー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30308d1b58679f80984b1f9ead5d1f23f0d8144171dd427d41aab30160ad5416",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41d3d6ebc01bcaf3badff2de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP，满了吧？赛事结果\\n是不是和模拟的一样，不去确认一下可不行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5540b9f02ae9fcc89568f43033b45901945c9d846f33fca7fcf8c2d62e9628",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ee0e360ab6ab89ee08b91b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经攒够了。\\n是时候检验我们积累的成果了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31e90b1e68d1dbed18d58cd52504815812b39f6f6745813cd04973c8f0a86791",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3728b976b4b16d516e3ac7a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "#RP #完全恢复 #出战赛事 #加油啦\\n#等待时间 #意象训练完毕 #真机伶是不是很棒？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07cda50c087b511169dcdab377a4fffddd9e9a878f5ff679951236cbf35c2deb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efb81b914fdaf737623e5aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP也满了！公主的干劲也满了！\\n要在赛事里尽情大干一场哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e7250ea24a3b9e1481cfc60970f25c516f7d324bae274785e363ea94136f06e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b9a764bf4e1304fda93dc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐，RP不是完全恢复了吗。\\n快让我跑起来吧。……等着你呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a657a1edb03c1504326f2ff06ad126f202d9de13c8239287b407d82e32c3433",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce1f7c4806859c590ea2a041",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗨，我是班长！RP已完全恢复！\\n来，请夸奖我吧！夸我报告得很及时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7b09ef572b263103c91c6c7a186d05c3f8dc4f2a92c39d8ef5d0fd0f578b32a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbb8013737c8c08d132dd780",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，RP好像满了呢。\\nOK！下一场赛事也要So Shine！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cffe6fb4594680c25c22eae494e21adb6e73a654fb8a4997eb65bd0240e1d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f559f027251e8dc522da5992",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "姆！RP攒满了！\\n要在赛事里大闹一场～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2012d8c8b7f7dbb9e25c0a9e033f4694f1cf92d05348f62a25eaaaecf57c38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4f5e9387d9b1d833f203926",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了哦，快点过来！\\n我想试试能赢下赛事的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc2f9cca692dac714157ce1cebfb5ca15012daf1d0eb7fa462eb9ea6fd69e11e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0e0400c81fba8f683853bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～，听说RP完全恢复了～！\\n我也会为了你努力的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa31c56de122b2f0bf6316f34fc590c5c53be630b6d302f003c6d9cd445b67f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66366f35130ccc033dae170d",
      "kind": "text_data",
