      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ded16376b784b6fb1d8dd18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，RP好像满了呢。\\n吃点脆脆饼，去赢一把吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca4a2b8e3045239f44bf18792b61a1d76e8072bc72980fbcfcbb8394eeb386ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159a6e8f4b223207ed8d0b63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP溢出来了……就像对你的Amore一样呢。\\n把这份燃烧的思念，在赛事中展现出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d660facd4a8b7d387f4629d76c3cf4e0a0c1ff3d12a398c136e207f553fc14d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cce1bf3bc4aeb60fa31b5a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP完全恢复了。\\n那么，Let's·小莱斯·Appeal！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2abbb0ecac448312246e1351615ce6a7767a2db96ea3faf18c02ddef4d0cf64f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5f69441c35cb01bf722d6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了！去挑战\\n那些强敌吧，作为王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "594fd04ead1c25b33e4dc99ff7e3eb3f6ad1c0515ff2dc955c7f6a7bb3d5e219",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b276f1771cc56e33d158192",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『RP』满了。\\n想在“Rendezvous”中感到『兴奋』呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60fb351a15ce54a303fdf48eaba233134dfc7c67e1366473717aea7caaa2609c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
